      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "The DB is the source of truth. The reconciler compares it with reality (Neutron ports, gateway maps, containers) and fixes drift,\nso a crash in the middle of a provisioning or teardown is repaired automatically.",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1602131913,
